\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia Rupiah Breaks 3,350 Vs Dlr -2: Joint  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 294 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 November 1997\par 05:37\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 SINGAPORE\b0 \highlight\uc2  (AP-Dow Jones)-- The Indonesian rupiah has strengthened sharply against the U.S. dollar in late morning trading Monday on concerted buying by Bank Indonesia, the Bank of Japan and the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Singapore. \par \par \uc2  At 0420 GMT (11:20 p.m. EST Sunday) the U.S. dollar is quoted at 3,260 rupiah, up from 3,600 rupiah in early trading and late Friday. \par \par \uc2  'The depreciation of the rupiah in recent months is excessive. Today's joint \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is aimed at promoting a strengthening of the rupiah to levels more consistent with the fundamentals of the Indonesian economy,' said Richard Hu, finance minister of Singapore, in a statement released Monday morning, adding that the three central banks 'stand ready to act again, as and when necessary, in the future'. \par \par \uc2  The extent of the U.S. dollar sales is unclear at present, but in a thin market the head of regional currnecy trading at a major U.S. bank in Singapore estimated the amount at $200 million. \par \par \uc2  'This is a show of force,' said a rupiah trader at a Japanese bank in Singapore. 'The central banks are sending a clear message to the markets in support of the IMF's package.' \par \par \uc2  Over the weekend, Indonesia announced a structural reform program backed by a multi-lateral and bi-lateral assistance package worth a total of $38 billion. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Between the beginning of July and the end of October, the Indonesian\par rupiah depreciated against the U.S. dollar by 34% largely under the\par pressure of demand for dollars from Indonesian corporates with unhedged\par foreign \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  debts.\par (Tom Holland; 65 421 4800; tom.holland@djmarkets.com.sg)\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 03-11-97\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0437GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtb308bj7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
