\par\par \b \uc2  SE Asian  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\uc2  Surge On Joint Central Bk Rupiah Buying \b0\par\par\uc2  By Tom Holland \par \uc2 258 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 November 1997\par 12:46\par \uc2  Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    SINGAPORE (DOW JONES)--Asian central banks flexed their\par market muscle on Monday. In a public display of strength and\par unity of purpose, the monetary authorities of Indonesia,\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Singapore\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  and Japan combined to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Singapore\f28 \b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market, driving up the Indonesian rupiah by\par 10% against the U.S. dollar.\par    By purchasing an estimated $500 million worth of the\par Indonesian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , Bank Indonesia, the Bank of Japan, and\par the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Monetary Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  of Singapore joined forces in a clear\par attempt to draw a line under the depreciation of the rupiah\par and, by extension, under the recent falls in other Southeast\par Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par    "This \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operation\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is aimed at correcting excessive\par depreciation of the Indonesian rupiah.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  I firmly believe that\par it should, together with the agreement of the Indonesian\par package formulated by the IMF, World Bank and Asian\par Development Bank, contribute to stabilizing the Indonesian\par economy," said Japanese Finance Minister Hiroshi Mitsuzuka,\par in a statement issued just before midday in Singapore.\par    In a separate statement issued simultaneously, Richard\par Hu, Singapore's minister for finance, emphasized the\par authorities' determination to support the rupiah. "The three\par monetary authorities stand ready to act again as and when\par necessary," he warned.\par    The rupiah surged in response to the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ,\par reaching 3,270.50 rupiah to the U.S. dollar in late Asian\par trading, sharply up from 3,605 rupiah at Friday's close and\par at its highest level since Oct. 1.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (MORE) DOW JONES NEWS  11-03-97\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0646EST\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1136 4340 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020011006dtb302cas\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
