\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Singapore \highlight\uc2 , Japan  \highlight22\uc2 intervene \highlight\uc2  in  \highlight22\uc2 forex \highlight\uc2  markets. \b0\par\par\uc2 242 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 November 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 SINGAPORE\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Nov 3 (Reuters) - The \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  (MAS) and the Bank of Japan (BOJ) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets on Monday in concert with Indonesian monetary authorities, the finance ministries of Singapore and Japan said. \par \par \uc2  Both ministries said the depreciation of the rupiah had been excessive. \par \par \uc2  Singapore Minister for Finance Richard Hu said in a statement the MAS bought Indonesian rupiah against the U.S. dollar in concert with the other authorities. \par \par \uc2  "\b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2 's participation in this joint \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  reflects our confidence in the macroeconomic policies of the Indonesian government." \par \par \uc2  The rupiah's depreciation in recent months was excessive, and the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was "aimed at promoting a strengthening of the rupiah to levels more consistent with the fundamentals," Hu said. \par \par \uc2  Japanese Minister of Finance Hiroshi Mitsuzuka said in a statement that Japan, Indonesia and Singapore "agreed that they would be ready to act in the market as and when necessary also in the future". \par \par \uc2  Speaking of Monday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , he said: "I firmly believe that it should, together with the agreement of the Indonesian package formulated by the IMF (International Monetary Fund), World Bank and Asian Development Bank, contribute to stabilizing the Indonesian economy." \par \par \uc2  The Indonesian rupiah shot to a high of 3,255 to the U.S. dollar following confirmation of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  -- \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  Newsroom (65) 870-3080; Fax (65) 776-8112 \par \par \uc2  -- Email: singapore.newsroom@reuters.com \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011003dtb303ebj\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
