\par\par \b \uc2  Singapore Dollar Down But Seen Supported In Short Term \b0\par\par\uc2 250 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Oktober 1997\par 04:52\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE (AP-Dow Jones)-- The Singapore dollar is down against the U.S. dollar in mid-morning trading Friday, compared with its level late Thursday. \par \par \uc2  The Singapore \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  fell from Friday's open, tracking the Malaysian ringgit, which dropped sharply on a local newspaper report which quoted Malaysian finance minister as saying no interest rate rises were foreseen. \par \par \uc2  Despite being dragged down by the ringgit's fall, the Singapore dollar's potential to drop further is limited in the short term, say traders. \par \par \uc2  With overnight interest rates on the Singapore dollar still at abnormally high levels following Thursday's liquidity squeeze, market participants are selling the ringgit against the Singapore dollar in order to pick up yield, say traders. \par \par \uc2  Coupled with fear of further \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the spot market or tightening in the money market, the positive carry versus the ringgit is helping to buoy the Singapore dollar, say traders. \par \par \uc2  'If Singapore dollar interest rates stay where they are for much longer, the ringgit will come under serious pressure,' said a trader at a major Singapore bank. \par \par \uc2  At 0250 GMT (10:40 p.m. EDT Thursday) the U.S. dollar is quoted at S$1.5797, up from S$1.5790 at the close of Asian trading Thursday. In the short term, say traders, the U.S. dollar is unlikely to rise above S$1.5850. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 24-10-97 \par \par \uc2  0252GMT \par \par \uc2  1163 1859 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtao0816z\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
