\par\par \b \uc2  Singapore Dlr Dn Late But Off Lows On Buying From Local Bks \b0\par\par\uc2 269 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Oktober 1997\par 11:45\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE (AP-Dow Jones)--The Singapore dollar is lower against the U.S. dollar in afternoon trading on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The Singapore dollar earlier fell sharply in reaction to comments made in Hong Kong by Singapore's prime minister Goh Chok Tong. Goh said the Singapore government is happy to let the market decide the value of the Singapore dollar, but added that Singapore could not emerge unscathed from the regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  crisis. \par \par \uc2  After reaching a low of S$1.5440 to the dollar around 0430 GMT (12:30 a.m. EDT), the Singapore dollar recovered some of its lost ground on what traders said was aggressive selling of U.S. dollars by local banks. \par \par \uc2  The assumption among market participants was that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the republic's de facto \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to check the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's fall. \par \par \uc2  'It's not confirmed but it is likely. The MAS doesnt mind seeing the Singapore dollar depreciate, but they like things to be orderly,' said an interbank trader at a large U.S. bank in Singapore. \par \par \uc2  At 0930 GMT (05:30 a.m. EDT) the U.S. dollar is trading at S$1.5417, up sharply from S$1.5355 in early trading Tuesday morning. \par \par \uc2  In the local money market, the overnight rate on Singapore dollar deposits is quoted at 2.125%-2.250%, a touch below 2.500%-2.625% earlier Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The three-month interbank rate is unchanged at 3.6875%-3.8125%. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 14-10-97 \par \par \uc2  0945GMT \par \par \uc2  1163 1859 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtae07pn1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
