\par\par \b \uc2  SE Asian  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\uc2 : Ctrl Bk Buying Checks New Rupiah Falls \b0\par\par\uc2  By Tom Holland \par \uc2 216 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 Oktober 1997\par 14:04\par \uc2  Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 SINGAPORE\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  (DOW JONES)--\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central bank intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  brought\par little relief for the battered Indonesian rupiah in another\par day of volatile trading in Southeast Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par markets Monday.\par    Demand from Indonesian corporations for U.S. dollars to\par hedge their short-term foreign \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 -denominated debt\par sent the rupiah spiraling downwards right from the start of\par Asian trading.\par    The beleaguered \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  reached a new low of 3,840\par rupiah to the U.S. dollar - down over a third from its\par pre-crisis levels - before Bank Indonesia entered the market\par to check the decline.\par    "Bank Indonesia's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has provided a reprieve\par for the rupiah, but it will only have a short-term effect.\par At the end of the day what is driving the market is the\par demand for U.S. dollars," said the Singapore-based head of\par regional \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  trading at a major U.S. bank.\par    Nonetheless the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's action did succeed in\par steadying the rupiah.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  ended Asian trading at\par 3,707.5 rupiah to the U.S. dollar, above its earlier low,\par but still well below its level of 3,640 rupiah at the close\par of Asian trading Friday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (MORE) DOW JONES NEWS  10-06-97\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0804EDT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1136 4340 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020011006dta6023vv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
