\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Singapore \highlight\uc2  Dollar Higher Early On Suspected MAS  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 247 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 August 1997\par 05:42\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 SINGAPORE\b0 \highlight\uc2  (AP-Dow Jones)--The \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar is higher against the U.S. dollar in late morning trading on what traders believe is \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the city-state's de facto \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Large domestic banks were seen selling U.S. dollars in volume around 0130 GMT (9:30 p.m. EDT) as the U.S. dollar hit S$1.5370, its highest level in 38 months. \par \par \uc2  At 0330 GMT (11:30 p.m. EDT), the U.S. dollar is quoted at S$1.5290, down from its day's high, but still sharply above S$1.5185 in late Asian trading Thursday. \par \par \uc2  On the Asian open, the U.S. dollar immediately soared against all regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , including the Singapore dollar, largely on local corporations buying the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , according to traders. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. dollar's rise against the Singapore dollar was checked at S$1.5370, before the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was driven back to S$1.5250 by the domestic banks' offer. \par \par \uc2  'The big local banks were selling (U.S. dollars) much more aggressively than usual,' said one trader at a Singapore bank. \par \par \uc2  In late morning trading, the U.S. dollar has stabilized just below S$1.5300. Volumes are thin, say traders, with few transactions exceeding $2 to $3 million. \par \par \uc2  'The market is very nervous,' said one trader. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 29-08-97 \par \par \uc2  0342GMT \par \par \uc2  1163 1859 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt8t06hy1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
