\par\par \b \uc2  Singapore Dollar Lower Late But Above Friday's Low \b0\par\par\uc2 284 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 August 1997\par 11:50\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE (AP-Dow Jones)--The Singapore dollar is lower against the U.S. dollar in late trading Monday, compared with its level Monday morning. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , however, is holding steady above Friday's 37-month low of S$1.5240 to the U.S. dollar, and traders do not expect it to weaken further in the immediate future. \par \par \uc2  At 0930 GMT (5:30 a.m. EDT) the U.S. dollar is trading at S$1.5170, up from S$1.5113 in mid-morning trading. \par \par \uc2  Many traders expect the U.S. dollar to continue to trade within today's range of S$1.5050 to S$1.5200 in the near term, with fears of possible \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the republic's de facto \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , capping the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's upside at S$1.5200. \par \par \uc2  'There will be no upside breakout (for the U.S. dollar) for the time being, unless we see new highs against the other regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,' says one trader at a European bank in Singapore. \par \par \uc2  Against the Singapore dollar, the ringgit is trading at S$0.5439, down from S$0.5458 earlier. \par \par \uc2  In the local money markets, short-term interest rates have eased since earlier Monday, although they remain substantially higher than recent levels. \par \par \uc2  The overnight rate on Singapore dollar deposits has dropped to 4.00%-4.25% from 4.50%-5.00% earlier. Late Friday the rate was at 2.625%-2.75%. The three-month interbank is steady at 3.875%-4.00%, up from 3.625%-3.75% late Friday. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 18-08-97 \par \par \uc2  0950GMT \par \par \uc2  1163 1859 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt8i063ix\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
