 percent, or 10 million, whichever is lower. \par \par \uc2  Newspaper reports quoted \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Gabriel Singson as saying he expected banks to unload $200 million due to the new ruling. \par \par \uc2  The peso was at 28.960/29.060 against its previous close at 29. \par \par \uc2  The Taiwan dollar slipped back from an early high of T$28.590, inspired by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's move to raise two key interest rates after the market's close on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  raised the rediscount rate to 5.25 percent from 5.00 percent and accomodations against secured loans to 5.625 percent from 5.375 percent, effective from Friday. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Sheu Yuan-dong said the rate hikes were aimed at maintaining stability in the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  The Taiwan dollar was at T$28.653/660 against Thursday's close at T$28.70, its weakest finish since 1988. \par \par \uc2  But dealers said the Taiwan dollar's gains would be limited as local importers were likely to buy dollars later in the day. \par \par \uc2  -- Syed Azman in Kuala Lumpur (603-206 2323), Mantik Kusjanto in Jakarta (6221 384-6364), James Mclean in Bangkok (662) 652-0642, Lilian Karunungan in Manila (632-841-8937), Kevin Chen in Taipei (8862-508-0815) and Sonali Desai in Singapore (65-8703090) \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt8101qkg\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
